 down small or peel off the cover.","column_2_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/AIO-HowItWorks-Desktop-HowtoWash-WashGently.avif","column_2_heading":"Wash Gently","column_2_text":"Machine wash cold with mild detergent.","column_3_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/AIO-HowItWorks-Desktop-HowtoWash-Dry.avif","column_3_heading":"Dry Thoroughly","column_3_text":"Tumble low or air dry until moisture-free.","column_4_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/AIO-HowItWorks-Desktop-HowtoWash-RollitOut.avif","column_4_heading":"Roll It Out Again","column_4_text":"Lay it down, smooth it out, live on it."},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_7e7b89b_PB6bLD"],"name":"How to Wash","settings":{}},"17799689330812526d":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_802db58_d66ALG":{"type":"ai_gen_block_802db58","settings":{"columns_desktop":6,"columns_mobile":"1","alignment":"left","desktop_width_percent":100,"section_padding":30,"grid_gap":10,"content_gap":5,"image_max_width":300,"image_border_radius":0,"heading_size":20,"heading_color":"#000000","text_size":14,"text_color":"#000000","image_1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/AIO-SizeGuide-LP-Entryway-Tufted-Doormat-Desktop.avif","heading_1":"Tufted","text_1":"Softly textured with cushioning.","image_2":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/AIO-SizeGuide-LP-Entryway-Tufted-Doormat-Desktop.avif","heading_2":"Flatwoven","text_2":"Smooth and low-profile.","image_3":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/AIO-SizeGuide-LP-Entryway-Tufted-Doormat-Desktop.avif","heading_3":"Plush","text_3":"Cozy and indulgently soft.","image_4":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/AIO-SizeGuide-LP-Entryway-Tufted-Doormat-Desktop.avif","heading_4":"Performance Weave","text_4":"Richly textured and soft underfoot.","image_5":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/AIO-SizeGuide-LP-Entryway-Tufted-Doormat-Desktop.avif","heading_5":"Re-Jute","text_5":"Earthy texture with a gentle feel.","image_6":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/AIO-SizeGuide-LP-Entryway-Tufted-Doormat-Desktop.avif","heading_6":"Outdoor","text_6":"Textured, sturdy, and low-profile."},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_802db58_d66ALG"],"custom_css":[],"name":"categories","settings":{}},"image_banner_MQCBDr":{"type":"image-banner","name":"t:sections.image-banner.presets.name","settings":{"image_overlay_opacity":0,"image_height":"medium","desktop_content_position":"middle-center","show_text_box":true,"desktop_content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"center","stack_images_on_mobile":true,"show_text_below":true}},"video_text_8EcbDm":{"type":"Video-Text","blocks":{"heading_LGHGm7":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"The Washable Rug","heading_size":"h1"}},"text_Y8UQzE":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>We created the category—and we’re still setting the standard.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}},"button_CxCfDq":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"SHOP ALL RUGS","button_link":"#","button_style_secondary":false}}},"block_order":["heading_LGHGm7","text_Y8UQzE","button_CxCfDq"],"custom_css":["p {text-align: center;}"],"name":"Video Text","settings":{"height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"center","content_layout":"no-overlap","section_color_scheme":"scheme-693beb50-5f8e-4cf0-b6f1-7f66ad5c3826","color_scheme":"scheme-693beb50-5f8e-4cf0-b6f1-7f66ad5c3826","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"center","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36,"subtitle":"Image with text","video_link":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/a337ab4cb56248c494ff38bd5944d224.mp4"}},"collapsible_content_AtQhQx":{"type":"collapsible-content","blocks":{"collapsible_row_nGaPgc":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How do Ruggable rugs work?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Ruggable rugs are made to handle real life—easy to maintain, washable, and designed to stay in place. Routine care includes vacuuming and <a href=\"https:\/\/ruggable.com\/products\/spot-cleaner\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">spot cleaning<\/span><\/a>, and when a deeper clean is needed, every Ruggable rug can go in the wash.<\/p><p>Ruggable offers two innovative rug systems:<\/p><ul><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ruggable.com\/collections\/all-in-one-rugs\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>All-in-One Rug System<\/strong><\/span><\/a>: A single washable rug with a built-in nonslip backing. No separate pad required. This system includes <a href=\"https:\/\/ruggable.com\/collections\/tufted-all-in-one-rugs\" target=\"_self\">Tufted<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/ruggable.com\/collections\/plush-all-in-one-rugs\" target=\"_self\">Plush<\/a>, and Performance Weave and is washed as one complete piece.<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ruggable.com\/collections\/flatwoven-rugs\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Two-Piece Rug System<\/strong><\/span><\/a>: A removable Rug Cover that attaches to a nonslip <a href=\"https:\/\/ruggable.com\/collections\/rug-pads\" target=\"_self\">Rug Pad<\/a> using a reusable cling-like layer. This system includes our <a href=\"https:\/\/ruggable.com\/collections\/flatwoven-rugs\">Flatwoven<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/ruggable.com\/collections\/re-jute-rugs\" target=\"_self\">Rejute<\/a>, and <a href=\"https:\/\/ruggable.com\/collections\/outdoor-rugs\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Outdoor rugs<\/span><\/a>. Simply remove the Cover to wash, then reattach it to the Pad. Covers are interchangeable, making it easy to refresh your space.<\/li><\/ul>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_nhhrxz":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What makes Ruggable rugs stay in place?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Both rug systems use nonslip technology to help keep rugs in place during everyday use.<\/p><ul><li><strong>All-in-One Rug System: <\/strong>Features a built-in nonslip backing.<\/li><li><strong>Two-Piece Rug System: <\/strong>Uses a grippy nonslip Rug Pad that anchors the rug to the floor.<\/li><\/ul><p>The backing keeps the rug from shifting on hard floors during everyday use, including busy households, kids, and pets.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_TnXE6d":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Do Ruggable rugs require a pad or come with one?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>It depends on the system:<\/p><ul><li><strong>All-in-One Rug System:<\/strong> No pad is required. The nonslip layer is already built into the rug.<\/li><li><strong>Two-Piece Rug System:<\/strong> Yes. The nonslip Rug Pad is required and is included with your first Rug Cover purchase as a set. After that, you can purchase additional Covers separately and reuse the same Rug Pad.<\/li><\/ul>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_mG9GQ3":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What rug pads does Ruggable offer?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p><strong>Standard Rug Pad (Required for Two-Piece Rug Systems) <\/strong>Designed specifically for the Two-Piece Rug System, the <a href=\"https:\/\/ruggable.com\/products\/standard-rug-pad\" target=\"_self\">Standard Rug Pad<\/a> uses Ruggable’s Cling Effect™ technology, allowing the Rug Cover to be detached and reattached without losing grip.<\/p><ul><li>Required for all Two-Piece Rug Systems<\/li><li>Compatible with Flatwoven, Re-Jute, and select styles (excluding Outdoor)<\/li><li>Best for high-traffic areas<\/li><li>Not compatible with All-in-One Rugs<\/li><\/ul><p>When it’s time to clean, simply peel off the Rug Cover, wash and dry it, then reattach it to the pad.<\/p><p><strong>Cushioned Rug Pad (Required for Two-Piece Rug Systems)<\/strong><\/p><p>For added softness underfoot, the <a href=\"https:\/\/ruggable.com\/products\/cushioned-rug-pad\" target=\"_self\">Cushioned Rug Pad<\/a> offers extra comfort while still supporting the removable cover system.<\/p><ul><li>Required for Two-Piece Rug Systems<\/li><li>Best for cozy spaces<\/li><li>Not compatible with All-in-One Rugs<\/li><li>Excluding Outdoor styles<\/li><\/ul>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_nGaPgc","collapsible_row_nhhrxz","collapsible_row_TnXE6d","collapsible_row_mG9GQ3"],"name":"Faq","settings":{"caption":"","heading":"FAQs on How Ruggable Rugs Work","heading_size":"h1","heading_alignment":"center","layout":"none","color_scheme":"","container_color_scheme":"","open_first_collapsible_row":false,"image_ratio":"adapt","desktop_layout":"image_second","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}}},"order":["main","image_banner_Dhab64","17799627288657cdd5","blocks_YcbeJK","17799689330812526d","image_banner_MQCBDr","video_text_8EcbDm","collapsible_content_AtQhQx"]}